    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Carl Burton, the creator of  IGF Finalist <i>Islands: Non-Places, <strong>MIRRIA</strong></i> is an atmospheric casual puzzle game where players navigate a strange, cryptic world that blurs the line between dream and reality. Using inspection and memory, players uncover hidden anomalies between mirrored worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND-CRAFTED BUT INFINITELY REPLAYABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome features a consistent theme, while areas within each biome are hand-crafted and mixed with dynamic puzzle elements \u2014enhancing replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A UNIQUE TWIST ON A BELOVED GENRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar mechanics reimagined with greater depth, beauty, and fluidity\u2014delivering a more rewarding and engaging experience than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DISTINCTIVE ART STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted aesthetic that defies genre conventions\u2014instantly recognizable and emotionally resonant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURPRISING AND INTUITIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal, ever-evolving world where every area is unexpected\u2014but the controls and goals are always intuitive. You\u2019re never lost, only intrigued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9159ad56e904bbf16e6d02088e316c57.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9159ad56e904bbf16e6d02088e316c57.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9159ad56e904bbf16e6d02088e316c57.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ATMOSPHERIC SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient sounds are modulated in real-time, creating a virtual instrument that makes every environment and playthrough a unique experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From Carl Burton, the creator of  IGF Finalist <i>Islands: Non-Places, <strong>MIRRIA</strong></i> is an atmospheric casual puzzle game where players navigate a strange, cryptic world that blurs the line between dream and reality. Using inspection and memory, players uncover hidden anomalies between mirrored worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/dd3d914380141e6bfe9b79cdd5a4e40d.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HAND-CRAFTED BUT INFINITELY REPLAYABLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome features a consistent theme, while areas within each biome are hand-crafted and mixed with dynamic puzzle elements \u2014enhancing replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9d6d9a841f8f7aee17d0fed7374b3d3a.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A UNIQUE TWIST ON A BELOVED GENRE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar mechanics reimagined with greater depth, beauty, and fluidity\u2014delivering a more rewarding and engaging experience than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/b59869b10a3d702c1b63ccf761167fbf.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A DISTINCTIVE ART STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted aesthetic that defies genre conventions\u2014instantly recognizable and emotionally resonant.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURPRISING AND INTUITIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a surreal, ever-evolving world where every area is unexpected\u2014but the controls and goals are always intuitive. You\u2019re never lost, only intrigued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9159ad56e904bbf16e6d02088e316c57.poster.avif?t=1747270853\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9159ad56e904bbf16e6d02088e316c57.webm?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3738340/extras/9159ad56e904bbf16e6d02088e316c57.mp4?t=1747270853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC ATMOSPHERIC SOUNDTRACK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient sounds are modulated in real-time, creating a virtual instrument that makes every environment and playthrough a unique experience.</p>",
